  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large earthenware bowl over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the mussels and clams and cook for 2 minutes until they start to open.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook for 2 minutes until they turn pink.",
    "Add the confit tomato, elderflower syrup, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2 minutes until the seafood is cooked through and the sauce has thickened.",
    "Serve the seafood bowl hot, garnished with fresh parsley or elderflower.",
    "Serve with crusty bread or over rice to soak up the flavorful sauce."
